      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Priddy%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Zion Evangelical Lutheran Church, a long‑standing community landmark, continues to serve Priddy with outreach programs and worship services.",
